Benefits of the Yomonsni approach

The Yomonsni approach believes in addressing, as much as possible, the whole of you. Your typical massage service works on soothing muscles and can give an indulgent relaxation, stimulating movement of tissue and fluid within, and for the time you are on the massage table, you are free from all the stressors of life. By working on your life and mind as part of the process, not only is the body soothed, but the recurrance of stress goes down through helping you to handle and approach life a little better. 






A Yomonsni massage

A Yomonsni massage tends to start with immersion in nature with a walk in the rainforest, conversation and life advice about whatever is on your mind. An oil blend is then crafted for your massage, working from a range of base and essential oils to create something unique for you. It will then proceed to a full mind and body (front and back) massage, drawing from elements of reiki, sweedish, thai and shiatsu massage, with many unique elements blended in through the intutitive nature of your practitioner. 



